# File Input

A drag-and-drop file upload component with image previews, file type icons, and size validation.

## Installation

::div{.space-y-4}
```bash
bunx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/file-input.json
```

```bash
npx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/file-input.json
```

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/file-input.json
```
::

## Usage

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
import { FileInput } from '@/registry/file-input'

const files = ref([])
</script>

<template>
  <FileInput 
    v-model="files" 
    :multiple="true" 
    :max-size="1024 * 1024 * 10" 
    :accept="['image/*', '.pdf']" 
  />
</template>
```

