### Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `multiple` | `boolean` | `true` | Allow multiple file selection. |
| `accept` | `AcceptType[]` | `[]` | Array of accepted file types (mimetypes or extensions). |
| `maxSize` | `number` | `undefined` | Maximum file size in bytes. |
| `disabled` | `boolean` | `false` | Disable the file input. |
| `v-model` | `FilePreview[]` | `[]` | Array of selected files with previews and metadata. |
